sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as ML Model / Application
    participant Online as Feature Server<br/>6566/TCP HTTP or<br/>6567/TCP HTTPS
    participant SecMgr as Feast SecurityManager<br/>OIDC / K8s RBAC
    participant Registry as Feast Registry<br/>6570/TCP gRPC or<br/>6572/TCP REST
    participant OnlineStore as Online Store<br/>(Redis 6379/TCP /<br/>PostgreSQL 5432/TCP)
    participant OfflineStore as Offline Store<br/>(DuckDB / PostgreSQL)
    participant CronJob as Materialization CronJob
    participant Operator as feast-operator<br/>Go Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,OnlineStore: Flow 1: Online Feature Retrieval
        Client->>Online: POST /get-online-features<br/>Auth: OIDC/K8s Bearer Token
        Online->>SecMgr: Validate token &<br/>check permissions
        SecMgr->>Registry: Lookup feature permissions<br/>Intra-communication JWT
        Registry-->>SecMgr: Permission decision
        SecMgr-->>Online: Authorized
        Online->>Registry: Resolve feature references<br/>gRPC/HTTP, Intra-comm JWT
        Registry-->>Online: Feature metadata
        Online->>OnlineStore: Read feature values<br/>Store-specific protocol & creds
        OnlineStore-->>Online: Feature data
        Online-->>Client: JSON/Protobuf response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over CronJob,OnlineStore: Flow 2: Feature Materialization (CronJob)
        CronJob->>Registry: Fetch feature definitions<br/>gRPC 6570/TCP, Intra-comm JWT
        Registry-->>CronJob: Feature views & entities
        CronJob->>OfflineStore: Query historical features<br/>Store-specific protocol & creds
        OfflineStore-->>CronJob: Feature data (batch)
        CronJob->>OnlineStore: Write materialized features<br/>Store-specific protocol & creds
        OnlineStore-->>CronJob: Write confirmation
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Operator,Registry: Flow 3: Operator Reconciliation (30s cycle)
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Watch FeatureStore CRDs<br/>HTTPS/TLS, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: FeatureStore CR events
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments,<br/>Services, ConfigMaps, RBAC
        Operator->>Registry: Fetch permissions for auto-access<br/>HTTP 6572/TCP, InsecureSkipVerify=true
        Registry-->>Operator: Permission policies
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create ClusterRoleBindings &<br/>RoleBindings for authorized subjects
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 255)
        Note over Client,Online: Flow 4: Feature Push Ingestion
        Client->>Online: POST /push<br/>Auth: OIDC/K8s Bearer Token
        Online->>SecMgr: Validate & authorize
        SecMgr-->>Online: Authorized
        Online->>OnlineStore: Write pushed features
        Online->>OfflineStore: Write pushed features (if configured)
        Online-->>Client: Push confirmation
    end
